<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - PIXAR started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - PIXAR started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said Wednesday analyst Harry Wagner started coverage of PIXAR Animation Studios Inc with ratings of near-term neutral and long-term accumulate.</p>
<p>Shares in the Richmond, Calif., digital animation studio opened up 1/4 at 16-1/4.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
